 * drifted far from it (different webhook path, an MCP server + DCR OAuth
 * provider, agent_view prompts, two OAuth redirect URLs, user scopes). Since
 * `apps.manifest.update` replaces the manifest wholesale, pushing the template
 * would delete all of that.
